<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine Jan producer prices rise 0.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine Jan producer prices rise 0.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's January producer prices rose 0.4 percent after a 0.9-percent rise the previous month, the Statistics Ministry said.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE PRODUCER PRICES   Jan 97   Dec 96   Jan 96</p>
<p>    mth/mth			 +0.4     +0.9     +3.4</p>
<p>Year on year figures were not available.</p>
<p>Producer prices rose 17.3 percent in 1996 after 172.1 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
